  "description": "Easily fold and store your bike, then unfold it whenever you're ready to ride. Perfect for easy transport and storage, making your travels more convenient than ever.\n\nEquipped with a 48V lithium-ion battery, the AndSky e-bike offers both Standard and Long-Range options, powering your ride for up to 40 or 60 miles respectively. The e-bike is fully certified to UL 2849 for added safety and reliability.\n\nExperience the power of our newly upgraded 1200W peak rear hub motor, delivering an impressive 70Nm of torque.\n\nOur cutting-edge mechanical disc brakes ensure dependable stopping power, giving you greater safety and control on every ride.\n\nThe AndSky e-bike is equipped with a Shimano 7-speed gear shift system, providing precise and versatile gear changes for a seamless and efficient ride. Choose the perfect speed for any adventure!",
